> - 操作类：下采样(downsample), 重涂色(recolor), 擦除(erase), 周期延伸(periodic_extension), 循环填充(cyclic_fill), 镜像(mirror), 对称补全(symmetry_completion), 连线(connect), 射线延伸(ray_cast/ray_extend), 描边(trace_path/outline), 展开嵌套(unfold_nest), 补全(reconstruct), 对接(dock), 裁剪(crop), 拼接(concatenate), 排序(sort), 旋转(rotate), 填充(fill), 提取(extract), 去重筛选(uniqueness_filter), 计数(counting), 平移(translate)
> - 对象类：分隔行列(separator_rows_and_columns), 标记字形(marker_glyph), 前景掩码(foreground_mask), 分隔列(separator_column), 色条(color_bar), 调色板列(palette_col), 长度标记段(length_marker), 主色前景对象(dominant_fg_object), 中轴线(center_axis), 标记像素(marker_pixel), 孤立像素(isolated_pixel), 画布边界(canvas_boundary), 块单元(block_cell), 象限(quadrant), 嵌套层(nested_layer), 遮挡矩形(occluding_rect), 对称图案(symmetric_pattern), 内部槽位(interior_socket), 可移动组件(movable_component), 结构体(structure), 连通精灵(connected_sprite), 色层(color_layer), 提示精灵体(cue_sprite), 中轴列(center_column), 前景像素(foreground_pixel), 带框精灵体(framed_sprite), 前景杂波(foreground_clutter), 全行条(full_row_bar), 全列条(full_column_bar), 方形网格(square_grid), 同心方环(concentric_ring), 十字图案(cross_pattern), 计数器像素(counter_pixel), 矩形精灵体(rect_sprite), 连通腔室(connected_chamber), 分隔墙(separator_wall)
> - 空间关系类：奇偶索引分离(even_odd_index_separation), 形状编码颜色(shape_encodes_color), 长度即周期(length_as_period), 对称(symmetry), 对角线对齐(diagonal_alignment), 对角线上阻挡(on_diagonal_blocking), 反射弹回(reflection_bounce), 块序映射层序(block_order_maps_layer), 双轴对称(two_axis_symmetry), 射线方向推断(ray_inferred_direction), 布局轴方向(layout_axis_direction), 同色匹配(same_color_matching), 顺序排列(sequential_order), 模式匹配(pattern_match), 正交邻接(orthogonal_adjacency), 距离映射(distance_mapping), 计数决定偏移(count_determines_offset), 交叉点(crossing_point)
> - 条件/判断类：保留偶索引交叉(keep_even_crossings), 按形状映射颜色(shape_to_color_mapping), 近者优先(nearest_first_priority), 标记高度决定长度(marker_height_run_len), 最高频色为目标(most_frequent_target), 忽略干扰项(ignore_distractors), 阻挡点发射正交线(blocker_emits_orthogonal_line), 对角遇边反射(diagonal_with_wall_reflection), 逆序读取(reverse_order_read), 镜像恢复遮挡区(mirror_recover_occluded), 轨迹涂黑(trail_painted_black), 按位置紧密排列(tight_packing_by_position), 像素数编码旋转(pixel_count_encodes_rotation), 仅保留中轴(center_axis_only), 图案仅出现一次(pattern_once), 异常值选择(outlier_selection), 交叉邻域环涂色(crossing_ring_recolor), 整体旋转(whole_grid_rotate), 切比雪夫距离(chebyshev_distance), 中心对齐(center_aligned), 计数器消失(counter_disappears), 邻接多数决(adjacent_majority_vote), 掩码变换匹配则补(transform_match_fill), 尺寸最大(largest_by_size)
>
> 设计原则：每题至少 2 个原语紧耦合；推理骨架互不相同。

